## Workspace contract

- `standalone` means the project must behave as if cloned independently.
- `workspace` means the private meta-repository integration overlay is intentionally active.
- Never substitute workspace success for standalone success.
- For Go, standalone commands in task worktrees set `GOWORK=off`.
- For uv, standalone validation runs from a task worktree excluded from the root uv workspace, using this project's own `pyproject.toml`/`uv.lock`.

## Rules

- Use the commands above instead of inventing alternate build/test paths.
- If a documented command is stale, update this file as part of the task.
- Record secret names only; never secret values.
